{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_title", "source_sha256": "238ced24940348df600ae5676c06c80001b641439406ac5aab41eb7e6e660ab2", "ja": "雪歩とおでかけ1", "zh": "和雪步出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c651478379a8228a6d93825e11f6d494d2f8e434c69d419572de6086ee1a8c21", "ja": "雪歩とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和雪步一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4f34e2de037ef770a858f7b72d2107ecaf82e2ca54f03a2bb875c0b50fef40ef", "ja": "わぁ～、すごい……。\n鹿児島に、こんな場所があるんですね。", "zh": "哇～，好厉害……\n鹿儿岛居然还有这样的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "efc28d3753ca82d27ae45dc70de7d09e1e24f6480567bded44d644c52c3bcdae", "ja": "たしかにちょっと非日常感があるな。\nどうだ？　明日のMCの参考になりそうか？", "zh": "确实有种非日常的感觉。\n怎么样？对明天的MC有没有参考价值？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ff48528a912e2db039b7a8a1b63134abc0bfe4d48a12cbc611954331c0ea36e7", "ja": "はい、とっても参考になりました。でも、ちょっと\n怖いですね。木陰から、なにか飛び出してきそう……。", "zh": "是的，非常有参考价值。不过，感觉有点可怕呢。总觉得会有什么东西从树荫下突然蹿出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1003_null", "source_sha256": "347c993c3e96679fd6c36fc47c0a83a4f7b0509087371635335dd2c45dd9489e", "ja": "バサバサッ", "zh": "哗啦啦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a3fa47ca22cb8f7d3c245330656f737ccc4064a357df30d6bca7c8b6ef2f1d18", "ja": "キャッ！？\n……な、なんですかぁ！？", "zh": "呀！？\n……什、什么呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "da13ec98aeb84088db0e96da1ddde7891ec86df2f5a3fb6d987524c695c7ef66", "ja": "どうやら、鳥みたいだな。\n大丈夫、もう遠くに飛んでいったよ。", "zh": "看来好像是只鸟。\n没事，已经飞远了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ad20e969e61b1e8878d1cabd5aabb6d65e407ee38cbc8422156b62a06f89aadc", "ja": "ホッ……び、びっくりしました。\n驚きすぎて、腰が抜けなくてよかったです……。", "zh": "呼……吓、吓了我一跳。\n还好没有被吓得腿软……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "767b1ea09106d4c4db7e66df39f74bed03fd0e892cda6949c04a357171da1e90", "ja": "あはは、大丈夫だよ。もしそうなったら、\nおぶってでも、みんなのところに連れて帰るから。", "zh": "啊哈哈，没事的。要是真成了那样，\n就算背着你，我也会把你带回大家身边的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6429729c76a4f70fa0053dff647b1e59dddf7b46315c17363681129de8e5682f", "ja": "そんなの、恥ずかしすぎます……\nあっ、でも……。", "zh": "那样实在太难为情了……\n啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_004yuk01_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "31dd4163724c796aee81e7db373899083f75b9f67093ebdc733d9a25cc702f04", "ja": "やっぱり、まだ怖いので……あとすこし、\nそばにいてもらえると、うれしいです……。", "zh": "果然，我还是有点害怕……要是您能再多陪我\n待一会儿的话，我会很高兴的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
